        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, it focused on continuing to accelerate the transformation of our workforce management technology through investments in upgraded systems and processes, increasing our ability to meet the quickly changing needs of our business, and maintaining a working environment and culture that is supportive of all employees and reflects our core value of “Respect Others.” We structure our people strategy and its implementation to comply with the laws and regulations to which we are subject as a federal government contractor.",
        "start_character": 17588,
        "end_character": 18114
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our safety and health program we seek to optimize our operations with targeted safety, health and wellness opportunities designed to provide safe work conditions and a healthy work environment, promote workforce resiliency and enhance business value.",
        "start_character": 20777,
        "end_character": 21035
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We achieve this by developing and investing in differentiating technologies, forging strategic partnerships, including with commercial companies, executing on our multi-year business transformation initiative, maintaining fiscal discipline, and continuing to cultivate the greatest aerospace and defense workforce talent and culture in the world.",
        "start_character": 1365,
        "end_character": 1711
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also develop and own other intellectual property, including copyrights, trade secrets and research, development and engineering know-how, that contributes significantly to our business.",
        "start_character": 12996,
        "end_character": 13184
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct research and development (R&D) activities using our own funds (referred to as company-funded or independent R&D (IR&D)) and under contractual arrangements with our customers (referred to as customer-funded R&D) to enhance existing products and services and to develop future technologies.",
        "start_character": 14258,
        "end_character": 14557
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in four business segments: Aeronautics, Missiles and Fire Control (MFC), Rotary and Mission Systems (RMS) and Space.",
        "start_character": 2269,
        "end_character": 2396
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of these environmental protection laws, we are involved in environmental remediation at some of our current and former facilities and at third-party-owned sites where we have been designated a potentially responsible party as a result of our prior activities and those of our predecessor companies.",
        "start_character": 30870,
        "end_character": 31180
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, certain classified fixed-price development and production contracts carry higher performance risk, and we are unable to insure loss to government property because the classified nature of the contracts prevents the disclosure of information necessary for underwriting and claims to commercial insurers.",
        "start_character": 29863,
        "end_character": 30174
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we invest in the development of our employees through training, apprenticeship programs, security clearance sponsorship, leadership development plans and tuition assistance for continuing education or industry certifications.",
        "start_character": 20176,
        "end_character": 20414
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-004195",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-004195-252829a67a8ce782",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-004195",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Various jurisdictions around the world in which we operate, including the U.S., the European Union, the United Kingdom, Australia and certain U.S.",
