        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We monitor developments in climate change-related regulation for their potential effect on us and also have a comprehensive sustainability program that seeks to mitigate our impact on the environment, including targets to reduce our GHG emissions.",
